### Listar todas las estaciones
GET http://localhost:3000/api/stations/all
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6NCwiZW1haWwiOiJhZG1pbkBnbWFpbC5jb20iLCJpYXQiOjE3OTA1NjA3MTgsImV4cCI6MTc5MDU2NDMxOH0.wme3rcqAQ0z7C-42TweO6t96_fgB0ulu9zP0nn6NJ8c

###

### Crear una estación
POST http://localhost:3000/api/stations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bueno",
  "code": "hola",
  "location": "FI",
  "operatingSystem": "WINDOWS",
  "classId": 3
}

###

### Crear otra estación
POST http://localhost:3000/api/stations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Estación 2",
  "code": "asdf12",
  "location": "FabLab",
  "operatingSystem": "ASD",
  "classId": 1
}

###

### Obtener una estación
GET http://localhost:3000/api/stations/3?limit=1
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6NCwiZW1haWwiOiJhZG1pbkBnbWFpbC5jb20iLCJpYXQiOjE3OTA1NjA3MTgsImV4cCI6MTc5MDU2NDMxOH0.wme3rcqAQ0z7C-42TweO6t96_fgB0ulu9zP0nn6NJ8c

###

### Update una estación
PUT http://localhost:3000/api/stations/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "nuevo2",
  "classId": 1,
  "code": "bueno"
}

###

### Update ignored
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/stations/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ignored": true
}

###

### Get estaciones por clase
GET http://localhost:3000/api/stations?classId=1&status=ignorada

###

### Crear reporte en una estación
POST http://localhost:3000/api/stations/9/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "declaredStatus": "OK",
  "agentVersion": "1.0.0",
  "ipAddress": "192.125.45.6",
  "cpuPercent": 46,
  "memoryPercent": 70
}

###

### Detalle de estación
GET http://localhost:3000/api/stations/4

###

### Eliminar estación
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/stations/13
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6NCwiZW1haWwiOiJhZG1pbkBnbWFpbC5jb20iLCJpYXQiOjE3OTA1NjA3MTgsImV4cCI6MTc5MDU2NDMxOH0.wme3rcqAQ0z7C-42TweO6t96_fgB0ulu9zP0nn6NJ8c
